From d6073e1e4625c6f72c3005c8b99ffdd14dfe544f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jassim Shanavaskhan <jshanava@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 11:03:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: add regulatory Tx power control parameters

Add support for regulatory Tx power and IE configuration
parameters through the TR-181 WiFi.Radio data model:

- EhtConfigCcfs0: EHT operating CCFS0 configuration
- TpeCommonPsd: common PSD in TPE IE for all subchannels
- TpePwrUnit: Tx power interpretation unit in TPE IE
- TpePunctChannelTxPwr: puncture channel Tx power in SP mode
- CtlPowerScale: control channel power scale factor (0-4)
- TxPowerScale: transmit power scale (0=100% to 4=min)
- TxPowerLimit2G: 2.4 GHz Tx power cap (0.5 dBm units)
- TxPowerLimit5G: 5 GHz Tx power cap (0.5 dBm units)
- AntennaGain2G: 2.4 GHz antenna gain in dBi
- AntennaGain5G: 5 GHz antenna gain in dBi

Signed-off-by: Jassim Shanavaskhan <jshanava@qti.qualcomm.com>
